{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gemmiferous is a Match 3 roguelike inspired by the likes of 'Slay the Spire,' 'You Must Build a Boat,' and the classic game 'Bejeweled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast dungeons beneath your manor and uncover old, hidden treasures. But beware of the dark and long-forgotten horrors that also lurk in these dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your way carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect gems, coins, and materials, and use them to repair the manor and its surrounding village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase various upgrades in the village shops, visit the tavern, and gamble all your hard-earned gems. Set up production of materials in the nearby forest, stone quarry, and iron mine. Decorate your village with the goal of making this place a new home for the people. Uncover all the mysteries of the manor and the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Playable Characters:</strong> As a lord, you will hire rogues to enter the dungeons for you, each offering a slightly different playstyle to keep the game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+ Monsters:</strong> Create a wide variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Event Rooms:</strong> The game offers a wide variety of random event rooms, bringing some RNG luck to the game, inspired by <i>Darkest Dungeon</i> and <i>Slay the Spire.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> In this game, you must think and match quickly in order to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Weapons and Items:</strong> Spend coins and gems in the village shops to make your next run more successful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Repair the Manor and Village:</strong> Repair the manor and village to gain access to many available facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Houses and Decorate the Village:</strong> Build houses and decorate the village to increase your population.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747110?t=1753992941","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/2f62e1796c6b6b7830bb0cfd95c5034fd91e75a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753992941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/8a4c6e1bca518a3d2826af8d0f0be55c19d0680f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753992941","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/8a4c6e1bca518a3d2826af8d0f0be55c19d0680f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753992941","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gemmiferous is a Match 3 roguelike inspired by the likes of 'Slay the Spire,' 'You Must Build a Boat,' and the classic game 'Bejeweled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast dungeons beneath your manor and uncover old, hidden treasures. But beware of the dark and long-forgotten horrors that also lurk in these dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/69d73e45b174ab97cde0a11641e5dc09.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your way carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/12b856b471ffd5c42e888b5218aa35ab.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect gems, coins, and materials, and use them to repair the manor and its surrounding village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/e03a1d87109fec41d9f7e621df0315fb.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase various upgrades in the village shops, visit the tavern, and gamble all your hard-earned gems. Set up production of materials in the nearby forest, stone quarry, and iron mine. Decorate your village with the goal of making this place a new home for the people. Uncover all the mysteries of the manor and the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.poster.avif?t=1753992941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.webm?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/extras/914ecef9011b73f7ab2e6920f523d876.mp4?t=1753992941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Playable Characters:</strong> As a lord, you will hire rogues to enter the dungeons for you, each offering a slightly different playstyle to keep the game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+ Monsters:</strong> Create a wide variety of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Event Rooms:</strong> The game offers a wide variety of random event rooms, bringing some RNG luck to the game, inspired by <i>Darkest Dungeon</i> and <i>Slay the Spire.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> In this game, you must think and match quickly in order to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Weapons and Items:</strong> Spend coins and gems in the village shops to make your next run more successful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Repair the Manor and Village:</strong> Repair the manor and village to gain access to many available facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Houses and Decorate the Village:</strong> Build houses and decorate the village to increase your population.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["JslovieDev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3507510","name":"Gemmiferous"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747110/ba9d2428b67eebd07a3cb12951a84421903bb796/header.jpg?t=1753992941","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.5<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Core2Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Core2Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257174140,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174140/movie480.mp4?t=1753992213","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174140/movie_max.mp4?t=1753992213"},"name":"Gemmiferous Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174140/702727b961216da4e53b1036374167c0983b1e99/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753992213","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174140/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753992213","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174140/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753992213"}}],"name":"Gemmiferous Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron